  <item>
    <title>no.38 大兴安岭，萨满和泰加林边缘的无声共振</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a72fdc91b5e24969ce95c93</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a72fdc91b5e24969ce95c93</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 09:22:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv8o3pUP7nNviXITPggpYtoDLKQ-.jpg"><p><strong><span>本期主播：gaochang/大黄 后期：gaochang </span></strong></p><p><span>暑假从海拉尔出发，往北走，经过阿龙山，根河，漠河，看了鄂温克驯鹿点，见了真的萨满，看到了基本是次生林的大兴安岭泰加林，这次就来录一期。</span></p><p><em><span>片头音乐：Uraan,Ayarkhaan - Ayar 片尾音乐：Huun-Huur-Tu - Mother Taiga</span></em></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 萨满和佛道教不算是一回事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="545">09:05</a> 见识了一下真萨满</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1305">21:45</a> 集体意识催生信仰</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2120">35:20</a> 可拍摄的萨满舞都是表演？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> 鄂温克族《额尔古纳河右岸》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2775">46:15</a> 真正的萨满衣服很沉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">01:00:00</a> 史禄国《通古斯人的心智丛》和 《达斡尔族的萨满文化传承》</span></p><p></p><p><span>节目中出现的书：</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrEbGqB0k-fw2N1q6SyvJTqXv_AH.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu8Rqu9RyU9l42dNThOcQh5l0yVF.jpg"><p><span>其他问题请联系vx: patient333</span></p>]]></description>
