  <item>
    <title>no.32 天惹！既然预言没有实现那我们聊聊梦境和北京的寺庙！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/687a08c9a9dec92500f10213</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">687a08c9a9dec92500f10213</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 18 Jul 2025 08:46:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期主播：gaochang/Pony 后期：gaochang</span></strong></p><p><span>本来这是一期没想放网上的节目没想到越聊越多……从龙树凉的漫画说到南疆旅游到北京寺庙许愿攻略。暑假也到了，如果来北京旅游的也可以来这几个地方看看。随便听听吧那就，各位~</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkFM6Fdzb_bGrzGvasm0dVktJG-0.jpg"></figure><p><strong><span>龙树凉的漫画</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtCYx_5ajVTouyLEcEdx_SGm5Mwn.jpeg"></figure><p><span>克孜尔石窟</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsIsOBmAmYDF1cbhperYNRVhuxRG.jpg"></figure><p><strong><span>北京雍和宫</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuouwSyxlZEHE88nzgxekeHkmxNp.jpg"></figure><p><strong><span>北京东岳庙</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqV0tp3oxERaYMb-ej4QgBkWhLqy.jpg"></figure><p><strong><span>北京火神庙</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 龙树凉的预言没有实现？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="417">06:57</a> 嘉宾做的一个关于去世朋友的梦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> 如果是真的有意义的梦你会马上就醒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a> 控梦？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1194">19:54</a> 量子催眠太贵了！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> 主播一个关于某某任务的记忆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a>新疆的地邪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1713">28:33</a> 乱入克孜尔石窟的故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2230">37:10</a> 雍和宫许愿秘诀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2725">45:25</a> 北京火神庙抽签</span></p><p><span>如有其它问题请联系微信：patient333</span></p>]]></description>
