    <pubDate>Mon, 05 May 2025 14:22:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期主播：果酱/Tina/gaochang 后期：gaochang</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>上个月果酱和Tina参加了森林康养师的的培训，这次让我们聊聊他们这次经历，两个本职和自然毫不相关的人是怎么体会这次森林体验的。后面乱入外星文明知识，总之大家听听就好～</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本期节目特别感谢大小电波 麦子店播客空间提供场地）</span></p><span></span><p><span>开场音乐 Olan Mill - Pine</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi_sEzfI-LH5ElusH3qyl2dGaZPT.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk74vdBmv0xlRnOBQj35T99l-grv.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp7ZryEw6kMOkhw4RsCWlvmVV_0U.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a> 森林康养师是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1022">17:02</a> 如何整合在地资源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1455">24:15</a> 执杖行走</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> 芳疗课：安陵容当作猫薄荷给胖橘的依兰精油</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2265">37:45</a> 男生对于自己的艺术作品更自信？大家都应该在自己能力范围内自信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3130">52:10</a> 求埃及旅游搭子；deepseek提醒主播之一不要沉迷外星文明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a> 颂钵也有证</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3488">58:08</a> 为什么有些灵魂会选择来地球当动物？</span></p><span></span><p><span>有其他问题请加微信patient333</span></p>]]></description>
