    <guid isPermaLink="false">680a5d0f7a449ae858840ac0</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 24 Apr 2025 15:55:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期主播：gaochang/夏楠 &nbsp;后期：gaochang</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>最近北理工的宫老师和常同学的事儿沸沸扬扬，有人说宫老师是拿了王尔德的剧本，但是事情怎么可以这么简单呢！请来了之前聊adhd的常和青少年打交道的夏老师来说说这件事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>先放两张王尔德和Bossie的照片洗洗眼睛……</span></p><span></span><p><span>（本期用了ai降噪，声音会有点奇怪=。=）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs_APEqXt3rYPkHg2pE0yRqHz0SE.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fueyvg6SAqBRZFE8sV2LfxFgeo5E.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期重点</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>王尔德和Bossie二三事</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>宫老师如此做法被发现是早晚的事</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>年龄和地位差距造成的不对等</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>金秀贤微表情矛盾</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>丑孩子的青春也是青春</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>女性是否过于注重情绪价值？</span></blockquote>]]></description>
