  <item>
    <title>no.28 先做出个垃圾出来！：读一读《唤醒创作力》你便不多余</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e171efdd11f9c8c1d3832a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e171efdd11f9c8c1d3832a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 24 Mar 2025 15:14:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期主播：gaochang/江老师 后期：gaochang</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>前段时间果酱老师推荐了一本书叫做《the Artist's Way》，中文版叫做《唤醒创作力》，读了之后感觉很适合想进行创作活动又进行不下去的人。这本书可以称得上是创作类经典“教材”，里面挺多小练习，大家可以跟着做做。</span><strong><span>(前两分钟设备问题有跳帧，后面就没有了，大家多包涵）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这次就录了一期节目来具体说说这本书。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近又看了一本叫做《多余的我》的小说，当时看封面介绍就感觉这两本书简直是一帮一、一对红，就在后面一起说说～</span></p><span></span><p><span>再给自己打个小广告，新的小漫画</span><a href="http://xhslink.com/a/Sgpz2ny33iC8" data-url="http://xhslink.com/a/Sgpz2ny33iC8"><span>《先做出个垃圾出来！》</span></a><span>（或者搜索gaochang或这个题目）在小红书不定期更新，欢迎大家看看～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmsUROJP5abfgyU2hVZ7ishf2HYJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtDz3gT2GAOkRmzbfAeDfr7LtYU6.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FurcXCmSOT9Z6mS0Wai2HtwrqV4E.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a>晨间笔记 是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a>艺术家之约</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1323">22:03</a> shower thoughts 为什么洗澡的时候想出了很多点子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1504">25:04</a> 超级制造者，你的拦路虎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2060">34:20</a> 艺术家型的手是什么样子的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a> 回避阅读</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 不要把对自己的剥削当作美德</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2900">48:20</a> 奢侈是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3420">57:00</a> AI实际已经融入创作生产了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4509">01:15:09</a>《多余的我》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4740">01:19:00</a> 现在工作日的公园里好多不上班的年轻人</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>其他问题请联系vx : patient333</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64e4e26ce490c5dee52fbab0/lnjA1G9pZsD8F1o3evQw2dg7Ii6-.m4a" length="121616541" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:23:51</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhraT_xliHXnHfmbNW5qtKkLYCO8.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>no.27 时间线混乱的今天，什么才是好时代：从梵高谈起</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67cdc775e924d4525a69c1f0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67cdc775e924d4525a69c1f0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Mar 2025 18:27:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期主播：gaochang/果酱 后期：gaochang</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqiUc0u4VxpdDb8J98TJX47-52dt.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>前段时间两位主播看了下关于梵高的纪录片，一开始觉得是人人皆知的艺术家所以有点兴趣缺缺，但后面却发现了很多以前忽略的知识和细节。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当时录制时是3月初，全球各种诡异的新闻，仿佛进入了混乱的时间线。人们总想回到以前的年代，也许那时会更好。</span></p><span></span><p><span>（后面因为二位主播照片都太丑所以把真人p掉了！）</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>最后的一首歌是 Roberto Vecchioni - Vincent，很喜欢这个版本，大家可以听完哦。</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>圣雷米疗养院附近对应的梵高画作景色</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvpt91VpCWNINnDjZMv2QobrXwIU.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>梵高的房间</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk4AI5UJpXw5fdn2ejpRP0WhW3ea.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>圣雷米的梵高疗养院</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lg2t1XdE16yts7wtvydtZYs7FWQk.jpg"></p><span></span><p><span>荷兰的梵高博物馆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpdVAWQRFn3FWOk7p2sNIEAr7oox.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>阿尔勒对应的的画作场景</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liPcz1n5bw_NtWIripVadQcF6q9z.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期摘要：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>梵高早期生涯</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>死于梅毒的各种名人</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>为什么有的颜色不稳定</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>“艺术家”颜料为什么比“学生”原料贵？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>印象派中为什么大量运用了黄色</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>主播前几年去阿尔勒和圣雷米的经历</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>梵高画作真正的幕后推手——弟媳约翰娜</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《午夜巴黎》《镀金时代》，为什么大家都想回到以前的年代？</span></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64e4e26ce490c5dee52fbab0/lnjcrSL25m4w0pYoBmQoWgiMnPmH.m4a" length="78712241" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:16</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgczfOPEjdUi0TfGZ-Ar1Xp7gUOV.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>no.26 内观vipassana: 无神论修仙指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b720e4606e5c5940c16ce5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b720e4606e5c5940c16ce5</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 20 Feb 2025 12:45:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期主播：gaochang/大黄 &nbsp;后期：gaochang 封面：gaochang</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>今年春节期间参加了一次内观vipassana(最近居然有点网红了！）, 十天时间不可以和外界交流。下面来记录一下，欢迎大家收听！</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>内观是一种通过观察自身身心现象来培养觉知和智慧的修行方法，源自佛教，尤其是上座部佛教传统。其核心在于通过专注观察身体感受、情绪和思维，达到对身心实相的深刻理解，从而减少痛苦，获得内心平静。</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>内观不仅用于修行，也被广泛应用于心理治疗和减压，如内观减压疗法（MBSR）和内观认知疗法（MBCT）。</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>（这次活动真的是被我“一鱼多吃”...还画了几期漫画，小红书搜索gaochang)</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fny_xVsnOaaL7zYYCcDtyuBQRrDQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 内观vipassana介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">6:40</a> 每天时间安排</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="508">08:28</a> 葛印卡介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">15:02</a> 需要带的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 观察呼吸和控制呼吸是两件事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2500">41:40</a> 世上很多事是靠恐吓传播下去的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 内观的终极目的是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3181">53:01</a> ADHD有所改善</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3330">55:30</a> 来之前3d建模要学好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3560">59:20</a> 插入一段克里希那穆提</span></p>]]></description>
